<!doctype html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Alpha Since — Accueil</title>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<link rel="icon" href="/img/logo.png">
<style>#dc-root .sc-host>*{margin-left:auto!important;margin-right:auto!important}@media (max-width:420px){#dc-root .sc-host>*{width:100vw!important;max-width:100vw}}</style>
<script src="/support.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
<x-dc>
<helmet>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Anton&amp;family=Roboto+Condensed:wght@400;500;700&amp;family=Caveat:wght@600&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
body{margin:0;background:#12110C;font-family:'Roboto Condensed','Arial Narrow',system-ui,sans-serif;color:#12110C}
a{color:#12110C}a:hover{color:#3F3C22}
input::-webkit-outer-spin-button,input::-webkit-inner-spin-button{-webkit-appearance:none;margin:0}
input[type=number]{-moz-appearance:textfield}
</style>
</helmet>
<div style="width: 390px; height: 11650px; box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; background: #E4E1B8; color: #12110C; font-family: 'Roboto Condensed', 'Arial Narrow', system-ui, sans-serif; overflow: hidden">
<header style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 44px 1fr 44px; align-items: center; padding: 12px 20px; background: #807C3A; color: #12110C">
<button onClick="{{toggleMenu}}" aria-label="Ouvrir le menu" aria-expanded="{{menuOpen}}" style="justify-self: start; width: 44px; height: 44px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: transparent; border: 0; cursor: pointer; padding: 0">
<svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#12110C" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="4" y1="7" x2="20" y2="7"></line><line x1="4" y1="12" x2="20" y2="12"></line><line x1="4" y1="17" x2="20" y2="17"></line></svg>
</button>
<a href="#top" aria-label="Alpha Since, accueil" style="display: flex; text-decoration: none; justify-self: center"><img src="/img/logo.png" alt="Alpha Since 1982" style="height: 92px; width: auto; object-fit: contain; flex-shrink: 0; display: block"></a>
<a href="#manique" aria-label="Boutique" style="width: 44px; height: 44px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; justify-self: end">
<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#12110C" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 4h2l2.4 10.2a1 1 0 0 0 1 .8h8.9a1 1 0 0 0 1-.8L20 8H6.2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="19" r="1.4"></circle><circle cx="17" cy="19" r="1.4"></circle></svg>
</a>
</header>
<sc-if value="{{menuOpen}}" hint-placeholder-val="{{ false }}">
<nav aria-label="Menu principal" style="position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 20; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 22px; padding: 14px 20px 32px; background: #12110C; color: #E4E1B8; border-bottom: 4px solid #F2E415">
<div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center">
<a href="#top" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" aria-label="Alpha Since, accueil" style="display: flex"><img src="/img/logo-alt.png" alt="Alpha Since 1982" style="height: 60px; width: auto; object-fit: contain; flex-shrink: 0; display: block"></a>
<button onClick="{{closeMenu}}" aria-label="Fermer le menu" style="width: 44px; height: 44px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: transparent; border: 2px solid #807C3A; border-radius: 999px; cursor: pointer; padding: 0"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#E4E1B8" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line></svg></button>
</div>
<a href="Test.dc.html" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 54px; background: #F2E415; color: #12110C; font-weight: 700; font-size: 19px; border-radius: 999px; text-decoration: none">Faire mon test physique</a>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column"><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #F2E415; padding-bottom: 6px">S'entraîner</span><a href="Test.dc.html" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3F3C22; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Test physique</span><span style="font-size: 14px; color: #A8A36A">7 tests reconnus et ton bilan</span></a><a href="Programme.dc.html" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3F3C22; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Ma préparation</span><span style="font-size: 14px; color: #A8A36A">Audit, objectif et programme complet</span></a><a href="#outils" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3F3C22; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Charge max, chrono, disques</span></a><a href="#outils" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3F3C22; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Quiz : quel matos pour toi ?</span></a><a href="#outils" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3F3C22; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Playlists Fun, Boost, Chill</span></a></div><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column"><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #F2E415; padding-bottom: 6px">Récupérer</span><a href="#recuperer" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3F3C22; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Quand s’étirer ?</span></a><a href="#recuperer" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3F3C22; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Routine souplesse 10 min</span><span style="font-size: 14px; color: #A8A36A">Guidée au chrono</span></a><a href="#sommeil" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3F3C22; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Mieux dormir</span><span style="font-size: 14px; color: #A8A36A">Mini-audit sommeil</span></a></div><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column"><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #F2E415; padding-bottom: 6px">Bien manger</span><a href="#quiz" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3F3C22; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Quiz nutrition</span></a><a href="Programme.dc.html" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3F3C22; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Plan alimentaire</span><span style="font-size: 14px; color: #A8A36A">Juste après ton audit</span></a><a href="#manger" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3F3C22; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Calculateur d’hydratation</span></a><a href="#manger" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3F3C22; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Compléments : ce qui marche</span></a></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column"><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #F2E415; padding-bottom: 6px">Boutique</span><a href="#manique" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3F3C22; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Manique X-Trm Confort</span><span style="font-size: 14px; color: #A8A36A">34,95 €</span></a><a href="#manique" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3F3C22; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Sangle et poignet de force</span><span style="font-size: 14px; color: #A8A36A">Bientôt disponibles</span></a></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column"><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #F2E415; padding-bottom: 6px">Coaching</span><a href="Suivi.dc.html" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3F3C22; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Suivi personnalisé</span><span style="font-size: 14px; color: #A8A36A">Sport ou sport + diététique, sans engagement</span></a></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column"><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #F2E415; padding-bottom: 6px">Conseils</span><a href="#conseils" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3F3C22; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Débuter</span></a><a href="#conseils" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3F3C22; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Mains et grip</span></a><a href="#conseils" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3F3C22; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Progresser</span></a></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column"><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #F2E415; padding-bottom: 6px">Alpha</span><a href="#quisommesnous" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3F3C22; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Qui sommes-nous ?</span></a><a href="#contact" onClick="{{closeMenu}}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #3F3C22; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Prendre contact</span></a></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px 16px; font-size: 14px"><a href="#mentions" style="color: #A8A36A; min-height: 36px; display: flex; align-items: center">Mentions légales</a><a href="#cgv" style="color: #A8A36A; min-height: 36px; display: flex; align-items: center">CGV</a><a href="#confidentialite" style="color: #A8A36A; min-height: 36px; display: flex; align-items: center">Confidentialité</a></div>
</nav>
</sc-if>
<section id="top" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 22px; padding: 28px 20px 40px; background: #807C3A">
<a href="Programme.dc.html" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; background: #12110C; color: #E4E1B8; border-radius: 16px; padding: 16px; text-decoration: none">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; flex-grow: 1">
<span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; color: {{accent}}">Gratuit · 5 minutes</span>
<span style="font-family: Anton, Impact, sans-serif; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.05; text-transform: uppercase; color: #FFFFFF">Fais ton audit physique</span>
<span style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.35">Ton niveau, ton objectif, ta préparation sur mesure. Et la vérité sur le temps qu'il te faudra.</span>
</div>
<span aria-hidden="true" style="width: 48px; height: 48px; flex-shrink: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: {{accent}}; border-radius: 999px">
<svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#12110C" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="13 6 19 12 13 18"></polyline></svg>
</span>
</a>
<h1 style="margin: 0; font-family: Anton, Impact, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 76px; line-height: 0.98; text-transform: uppercase; color: transparent; -webkit-text-stroke: 2px #12110C">Be ready where it all begins</h1>
<p style="margin: 0; font-family: Anton, Impact, sans-serif; font-size: 30px; line-height: 1.08; text-transform: uppercase; color: #12110C">On soulève lourd.<br>On se prend pas au sérieux.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.45; color: #12110C">Du matériel solide et des conseils clairs pour s'entraîner mieux, se vider la tête et ressortir de la salle de meilleure humeur qu'en y entrant.</p>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px">
<a href="#manique" style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 54px; background: {{accent}}; color: #12110C; font-weight: 700; font-size: 19px; border-radius: 999px; text-decoration: none">Découvrir la manique</a>
<a href="#outils" style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 54px; background: transparent; color: #FFFFFF; border: 2px solid #FFFFFF; font-weight: 700; font-size: 19px; border-radius: 999px; text-decoration: none; box-sizing: border-box">Calculer ma charge max</a>
<a href="Test.dc.html" style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 54px; background: #12110C; color: #F2E415; font-weight: 700; font-size: 19px; border-radius: 999px; text-decoration: none">Faire mon test physique</a>
</div>
<div style="height: 250px; border: 2px dashed #12110C; border-radius: 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center; padding: 20px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #12110C; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; background: #6E6A30">[PHOTO : main avec la manique sur un disque jaune, comme sur le site actuel]</div>
</section>
<section id="acces" aria-label="Accès rapide" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; padding: 32px 20px; background: #E4E1B8">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: Anton, Impact, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1; text-transform: uppercase">Tu viens pour quoi ?</h2>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 10px">
<a href="Test.dc.html" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; gap: 6px; min-height: 104px; padding: 14px; background: #12110C; color: #FFFFFF; border: 2px solid #12110C; border-radius: 14px; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-family: Anton, Impact, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.05; text-transform: uppercase">Test physique</span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.3; color: #D8D4A8">Savoir où j’en suis</span></a><a href="Programme.dc.html" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; gap: 6px; min-height: 104px; padding: 14px; background: #12110C; color: #FFFFFF; border: 2px solid #12110C; border-radius: 14px; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-family: Anton, Impact, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.05; text-transform: uppercase">Ma préparation</span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.3; color: #D8D4A8">Un programme sur mesure</span></a><a href="Programme.dc.html" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; gap: 6px; min-height: 104px; padding: 14px; background: #807C3A; color: #12110C; border: 2px solid #12110C; border-radius: 14px; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-family: Anton, Impact, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.05; text-transform: uppercase">Plan alimentaire</span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.3; color: #12110C">Mieux manger pour progresser</span></a><a href="Suivi.dc.html" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; gap: 6px; min-height: 104px; padding: 14px; background: #807C3A; color: #12110C; border: 2px solid #12110C; border-radius: 14px; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-family: Anton, Impact, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.05; text-transform: uppercase">Suivi coach</span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.3; color: #12110C">Être accompagné</span></a><a href="#manique" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; gap: 6px; min-height: 104px; padding: 14px; background: #807C3A; color: #12110C; border: 2px solid #12110C; border-radius: 14px; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-family: Anton, Impact, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.05; text-transform: uppercase">Boutique</span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.3; color: #12110C">Manique X-Trm Confort</span></a><a href="#conseils" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; gap: 6px; min-height: 104px; padding: 14px; background: #807C3A; color: #12110C; border: 2px solid #12110C; border-radius: 14px; text-decoration: none"><span style="font-family: Anton, Impact, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.05; text-transform: uppercase">Conseils</span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.3; color: #12110C">Guides et bons réflexes</span></a>
</div>
</section>
<div style="background: #12110C; color: #F2E415; padding: 16px 20px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; text-align: center">
<span>Le seul drame autorisé : la dernière répétition</span>
<span style="color: #E4E1B8">Ici on soulève des barres, pas des polémiques</span>
</div>
<section id="quisommesnous" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; padding: 44px 20px; background: #4A4620; color: #E4E1B8">
<div style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: {{accent}}">Qui sommes-nous ?</div>
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: Anton, Impact, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 42px; line-height: 1; text-transform: uppercase; color: #FFFFFF">Plus qu'une marque, un état d'esprit</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.5">ALPHA, c'est une quête de puissance et de renouveau. Chaque accessoire reflète notre engagement pour la performance, la résilience et l'authenticité, que tu sois athlète confirmé ou passionné qui veut se dépasser.</p>
<div style="height: 1px; background: #807C3A"></div>
<div style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: {{accent}}">Notre histoire</div>
<h3 style="margin: 0; font-family: Anton, Impact, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.05; text-transform: uppercase; color: #FFFFFF">Une marque, une vision, un mindset</h3>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.5">Alpha s'inspire du phénix : chacun peut se réinventer et surmonter les obstacles. Pour nous, le sport est plus qu'une activité physique. C'est un voyage, jour après jour, vers la meilleure version de toi-même.</p>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; padding-top: 4px">
<div style="display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: flex-start">
<span style="font-family: Anton, Impact, sans-serif; font-size: 44px; line-height: 0.9; color: {{accent}}; width: 30px">1</span>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px"><span style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 19px; color: #FFFFFF">Force et sérénité</span><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.4">L'équilibre pour atteindre tes objectifs.</span></div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: flex-start">
<span style="font-family: Anton, Impact, sans-serif; font-size: 44px; line-height: 0.9; color: {{accent}}; width: 30px">2</span>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px"><span style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 19px; color: #FFFFFF">Simplicité et excellence</span><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.4">Le soin dans chaque détail, dans chaque choix.</span></div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: flex-start">
<span style="font-family: Anton, Impact, sans-serif; font-size: 44px; line-height: 0.9; color: {{accent}}; width: 30px">3</span>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px"><span style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 19px; color: #FFFFFF">Résilience et renouveau</span><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.4">Comme le phénix, on se relève. Encore et encore.</span></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; padding: 40px 20px; background: #E4E1B8">
<div style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #4A4620">L'esprit Alpha</div>
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: Anton, Impact, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 40px; line-height: 1; text-transform: uppercase">Sérieux sur la technique. Pour le reste…</h2>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; background: #12110C; color: #E4E1B8; border-radius: 14px; padding: 10px">
<div style="height: 130px; border-radius: 8px; background: #3F3C22; border: 1px dashed #A8A36A; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center; font-size: 13px; color: #D8D4A8; padding: 8px; box-sizing: border-box">[PHOTO : paume ouverte]</div>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.35">« Nos maniques protègent vos mains. Pour votre ego, on cherche encore. »</p>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; background: #12110C; color: #E4E1B8; border-radius: 14px; padding: 10px">
<div style="height: 130px; border-radius: 8px; background: #3F3C22; border: 1px dashed #A8A36A; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center; font-size: 13px; color: #D8D4A8; padding: 8px; box-sizing: border-box">[PHOTO : banc de développé couché]</div>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.35">« Lundi, développé couché. Comme partout. On n'a pas trouvé mieux. »</p>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; background: #12110C; color: #E4E1B8; border-radius: 14px; padding: 10px">
<div style="height: 130px; border-radius: 8px; background: #3F3C22; border: 1px dashed #A8A36A; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center; font-size: 13px; color: #D8D4A8; padding: 8px; box-sizing: border-box">[PHOTO : barre de traction]</div>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.35">« Rater sa dernière rep, c'est pas un échec. C'est une rep de caractère. »</p>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; background: #12110C; color: #E4E1B8; border-radius: 14px; padding: 10px">
<div style="height: 130px; border-radius: 8px; background: #3F3C22; border: 1px dashed #A8A36A; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center; font-size: 13px; color: #D8D4A8; padding: 8px; box-sizing: border-box">[PHOTO : gourde et serviette]</div>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.35">« On compte les reps jusqu'à 10. Parfois 8. On reste honnêtes. »</p>
</div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; background: #12110C; color: #E4E1B8; border-left: 6px solid {{accent}}; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px">
<span style="font-family: Anton, Impact, sans-serif; font-size: 30px; line-height: 1.05; text-transform: uppercase; color: #FFFFFF">La motivation te fait commencer.<br><span style="color: {{accent}}">La discipline te fait revenir.</span></span>
<span style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.45">Chez Alpha, on ne compte pas sur l'envie du jour. On installe des habitudes : une séance calée dans l'agenda, un chrono qui décide pour toi, un repas préparé la veille. Les jours sans envie, c'est la discipline qui fait le travail.</span>
